<title>USA: Biodynamics Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Biodynamics Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>				    Three Months	Six Months</p>
<p>				    Ended March 31,  Ended March 31,</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues		 $2,138    $ 3,509     $4,624     $5,538</p>
<p> Net Loss		(1,067)	(392)    (1,707)    (1,423)</p>
<p> Net Loss Per Share   (0.12)     (0.05)     (0.20)     (0.18)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said results for both current and proir periods fell because of the Japanese Ministry of Health's banning and recall of dura mater, a human brain tissue, in response to a recommendation from the United Nation's World Health Organization.</p>
<p>Full name is Biodynamics International Inc.</p>
